# Monarchy account roles. Copy to /etc/monarchy/users.conf on each box.
# NEVER commit the real file: usernames are personal information, and this
# repo is public. See the No names rule in AGENTS.md.
#
#   <username> <role>
#
# king   administers the box. One per machine.
# queen  co-adult, unrestricted, does not administer. One per machine.
# kid    supervised. Many. Future restrictions hang off this role.
# serf   anyone else, including guests. Many.
#
# An account missing from this file is a serf. That is a valid state, not an
# error, and nothing is done to serfs beyond the defaults.
#
# Session at the greeter follows from the role: the default is Omarchy, and
# queen and kid are overridden to Plasma. Roles are defined in CONTEXT.md.
#
# Fill this in with monarchy-user-setup, or by hand:

king    king
queen   queen
kid1    kid
